WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:08.000
Wie hat der 7. Oktober dein Gefühl von Sicherheit
verändert – und das, was Heimat und Zugehörigkeit
für Dich bedeutet?

00:09.400 --> 00:11.700
That is a very

00:11.800 --> 00:13.233
profound question...

00:17.800 --> 00:20.200
I will share something very personal,

00:20.933 --> 00:24.000
I started getting, many people

00:24.000 --> 00:26.966
started getting help,

00:27.100 --> 00:28.133
psychological help...

00:28.133 --> 00:33.000
after October 7 to deal with the trauma.

00:33.733 --> 00:37.766
And I remember one day that I was sitting with my...

00:37.900 --> 00:38.966
Psychologist...

00:39.466 --> 00:43.333
and I wanted to speak about my house in Nahal Oz,

00:43.433 --> 00:48.133
and the words I used were "the building in Nahal Oz",

00:48.866 --> 00:50.666
and once I said that sentence,

00:50.666 --> 00:52.933
I was like...

00:53.133 --> 00:54.333
It was just then,

00:54.333 --> 00:59.100
that I realized that I feel very detached,

00:59.866 --> 01:01.866
from my house now.

01:01.866 --> 01:03.933
Nahal Oz is a place that...

01:04.100 --> 01:06.233
We've been through quite a lot here,

01:07.266 --> 01:10.900
we had many difficult incidents throughout the years,

01:11.033 --> 01:13.300
when people say it didn’t start on October 7,

01:13.300 --> 01:14.733
they are right,

01:14.733 --> 01:16.433
it didn’t start on October 7,

01:16.633 --> 01:18.733
we had many difficult incidents here,

01:18.733 --> 01:19.833
throughout the years...

01:20.633 --> 01:22.300
including...

01:22.300 --> 01:25.966
a yellow school bus that was targeted by a...

01:26.266 --> 01:30.500
laser-guided anti-tank missile including.

01:30.666 --> 01:35.433
A four-and-a-half year old child that died here,

01:35.433 --> 01:38.433
from a sharp nail that entered his house.

01:38.433 --> 01:40.833
Including many things throughout the years,

01:42.266 --> 01:44.866
and, I've never wanted to leave.

01:44.866 --> 01:46.566
Never...

01:46.700 --> 01:50.633
I always said that I will stay here no matter what...

01:51.000 --> 01:53.100
because of the story of my family.

01:53.100 --> 01:56.566
Are we getting there later?

01:58.200 --> 01:59.233
Okay,

01:59.233 --> 02:01.833
so I will touch it a little bit...

02:03.433 --> 02:08.533
After a terrible incident happened...

02:10.266 --> 02:12.066
I used to think about my family,

02:12.066 --> 02:14.000
my family...

02:14.000 --> 02:15.500
I'm Middle Eastern to the backbone,

02:15.500 --> 02:16.466
Middle Eastern,

02:16.466 --> 02:18.500
North African. I'm from the region,

02:19.100 --> 02:22.800
I couldn’t be imperialist even if I wanted to...

02:24.433 --> 02:26.033
And, I always say that...

02:26.033 --> 02:28.633
I'm the first indigenous imperialist known to mankind...

02:31.500 --> 02:32.933
and, I've got nowhere to go.

02:32.933 --> 02:35.100
Nobody is doing me a favor and letting me leave,

02:35.100 --> 02:36.200
in the Middle East,

02:36.200 --> 02:37.600
I couldn’t be in Paris this year,

02:38.700 --> 02:40.300
I couldn’t...

02:40.400 --> 02:43.033
Now if you want to open the world map,

02:43.033 --> 02:45.166
and show us where our haven is,

02:45.400 --> 02:47.500
it would be fantastic.

02:47.500 --> 02:48.400
People around the world,

02:48.400 --> 02:49.866
that tell us to go back to Europe,

02:49.866 --> 02:51.133
I come from Libya,

02:51.266 --> 02:52.900
it’s a bit problematic...

02:55.233 --> 02:58.333
And, my family was terrorized throughout the years.

02:58.333 --> 03:00.733
I'm second generation to refugees from...

03:00.733 --> 03:02.600
My mom is a refugee from Libya,

03:02.933 --> 03:05.766
she was terrorized out as a child with her family,

03:06.333 --> 03:10.533
And when that thought crossed my mind,

03:11.066 --> 03:13.000
when things happened around here,

03:13.000 --> 03:17.433
I said maybe I will be that link in the chain,

03:17.433 --> 03:19.266
that did not submit to terror,

03:19.266 --> 03:21.533
that did not...

03:21.533 --> 03:26.233
move around because she was terrorized...

03:30.033 --> 03:32.100
And, October 7 broke that...

03:32.400 --> 03:33.033
I think that...

03:33.033 --> 03:35.633
October 7 was the first time that I realized,

03:35.633 --> 03:39.200
it took me about a couple of weeks,

03:39.200 --> 03:41.266
after all the stories gathered,

03:41.266 --> 03:43.066
because we were in our safe rooms,

03:43.066 --> 03:46.300
we didn’t know what was going on in all the other

03:47.000 --> 03:49.266
locations around us so...

03:49.266 --> 03:51.266
when the stories started gathering in...

03:51.266 --> 03:55.000
and we heard the horrible stories about...

03:56.466 --> 03:58.633
mutilations and...

03:58.633 --> 04:01.333
horrible rapes and brutal

04:01.333 --> 04:02.733
murders...

04:02.733 --> 04:06.400
There was one Thai worker...

04:08.266 --> 04:11.800
that was here for quite a while...

04:12.866 --> 04:14.500
they killed him with a shovel...

04:16.700 --> 04:19.100
a few meters from my house,

04:19.100 --> 04:22.700
this is something that you can’t even...

04:25.033 --> 04:27.933
you can’t digest something like that...

04:27.933 --> 04:30.933
It’s very difficult to...

04:30.933 --> 04:31.633
So I think that...

04:31.633 --> 04:35.300
it took me about a couple of weeks to realize that...

04:35.300 --> 04:36.333
just like my mom,

04:36.333 --> 04:39.600
I survived a massacre in the Middle East.

04:42.400 --> 04:45.600
And, I think that it was the first time,

04:45.633 --> 04:49.900
that the level of terror

04:49.900 --> 04:53.766
got to the level of terror that they used to face,

04:54.133 --> 04:56.300
back in Libya...

04:56.300 --> 04:58.200
or here in the region of Israel,

04:58.200 --> 05:00.000
where my father's family was,

05:00.133 --> 05:01.600
for years and years and years,

05:01.600 --> 05:03.200
in Hebron, Gaza...

05:03.300 --> 05:04.233
Jerusalem.

05:04.233 --> 05:04.800
My father,

05:04.800 --> 05:06.833
as a child went through the siege in Jerusalem.

05:06.900 --> 05:09.133
They're here for generations on generations

05:09.133 --> 05:11.700
on generations...

05:14.800 --> 05:17.066
I thought that I would be that link in the chain,

05:19.200 --> 05:23.566
submit to terror and today I'm not that sure...

05:26.666 --> 05:30.100
I still think about...

05:30.266 --> 05:32.133
coming back here or not,

05:32.133 --> 05:35.633
my family really wants to come back,

05:36.266 --> 05:38.833
my son...

05:38.833 --> 05:42.033
is afraid about it. I have a handicapped son,

05:42.033 --> 05:44.833
he can not run for shelter

05:44.833 --> 05:46.200
in a few seconds.

05:46.933 --> 05:48.900
So for now...

05:48.900 --> 05:50.833
we’re out of the kibbutz for another year,

05:50.833 --> 05:52.800
and we'll see what happens then...
